ALEX: S&P 500 at 7515.80, up 0 point five seven percent. Nasdaq at 26610.08, up 1 point zero one percent. Russell 2000 is up 1 point four four percent, which means small caps are outrunning the mega-cap index.

3
00:00:20,879 --> 00:00:25,518
